@format 1
@id funnel.remove-rule
@title Remove funnel rule
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Remove one requested funnel rule and renumber the remaining ordered rules.
@section I. UI
@tabs Funnel
@flow TB
@related funnel.add-rule, funnel.move-rule

@alias rules = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PFunnelRules

[input] Rule removal requested <input>
- Receive the row's remove event @ rules.PFunnelRuleRemove(...)
> remove

[remove] Remove rule <process>
- Clear selection when it belongs to the row and detach the row from model and view @ rules.PFunnelRuleRemove(...)
- Reapply order numbers and empty-state visibility @ rules.PFunnelOrderApply(...)
> result

[result] Rule removed <output>
= The remaining rules keep their relative order and contiguous numbers.
